{"timestamp": "2025-05-09T12:54:17.631570", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Start with the recipe for the desired item\n  recipe = env.world.recipes[item]\n  \n  actions = []\n  \n  # Iterate through the recipe to determine which items need to be collected and crafted first\n  while any(isinstance(value, dict) for value in recipe.values()):\n    for ingredient_index, count in recipe.items():\n      if isinstance(count, dict):  # If it's a nested dictionary, we have to craft this item first\n        actions.append(env.world.cookbook.index[ingredient_index])\n        # Update the recipe with the crafted items as they become available\n        recipe = env.world.primitives_for(env.world.cookbook.index[ingredient_index])\n        break  # Break out of the loop to start crafting the next item in the list\n  \n  return actions", "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
