{"timestamp": "2025-05-09T20:33:56.078760", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Initialize an empty list to store the actions\n  actions = []\n  \n  # Get the recipe for the desired item from the world configuration\n  target_recipe = env.world.recipes[item]\n  \n  # Iterate through each ingredient in the recipe\n  for key, value in target_recipe.items():\n    if key == \"_key\":\n      continue  # Skip the output itself\n    \n    # Find the index of the required primitive resource\n    item_index = env.world.cookbook.index[key]\n    \n    # Check if the ingredient is already in the inventory\n    while env._current_state.inventory[item_index] < value:\n      for action in range(4):  # Try to move towards items needed (UP, DOWN, LEFT, RIGHT)\n        new_pos = env._current_state.move(action)\n        if env._current_state.grid[new_pos] == item_index:\n          actions.append(action)\n          break\n      else:  # If no action is successful, break the loop\n        break\n    \n    # Add an use action for each ingredient needed\n    actions.append(4)  # USE action to craft the item\n  \n  return actions", "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
