{"timestamp": "2025-05-09T23:42:00.499276", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the recipe for the desired item\n  recipe = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(item)\n  \n  # If no direct recipe is found, return an empty list or a default action sequence\n  if not recipe:\n    return []\n\n  actions = [1] * len(recipe) + [4]\n  \n  # Check the current inventory to see if all required items are available\n  needed_items = set(recipe.keys())\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  for item in needed_items:\n    if inventory[item] == 0:\n      return []  # If any item is missing, return an empty list\n  \n  return actions", "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": 1.0}}
