{"timestamp": "2025-05-10T10:05:20.991024", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  goal = env.world.cookbook.index[item]\n  recipe = env.world.primitives_for(goal)\n\n  actions = []\n  for kind, count in recipe.items():\n    # Find the position of the kind in the inventory\n    pos = np.where(env._current_state.inventory == kind)[0][0]\n    \n    # Move to the item if it's not already in the inventory\n    while env._current_state.pos != pos:\n      if env._current_state.pos < pos:\n        actions.append(0)  # Move right\n      else:\n        actions.append(1)  # Move left\n    \n    # Use the item to add it to the inventory\n    actions.append(4)  # Use action\n  \n  return actions", "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
