{"timestamp": "2025-05-10T10:05:24.815591", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Check if the goal is achievable from the initial state\n  inventory = env._current_state.inventory\n  if inventory[item] > 0:\n    return []  # Already have the item, no need to craft\n\n  # Get the recipe for the desired item\n  cookbook = env.world.cookbook\n  recipe = cookbook.recipes[item]\n\n  # Find all items that are required to craft the goal\n  needed_items = {}\n  for key, count in recipe.items():\n    if isinstance(key, str) and key != \"_key\":\n      if key not in needed_items:\n        needed_items[key] = count\n      else:\n        needed_items[key] += count\n\n  # Find the items that are already in the inventory\n  available_items = {k: inventory[k] for k in needed_items.keys() if inventory[k] > 0}\n\n  # Sort the items by their counts (descending) and then by index (ascending)\n  sorted_needed_items = sorted(needed_items.items(), key=lambda x: (-x[1], env.world.cookbook.index[x[0]]))", "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
