{"timestamp": "2025-05-10T13:30:08.083581", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the recipe for the specified item\n  recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes[item]\n  \n  # Initialize an empty list to store actions (indices)\n  actions = []\n\n  # Iterate over each ingredient in the recipe\n  for ingredient_index, count in recipe.items():\n    if isinstance(ingredient_index, str) and ingredient_index.startswith(\"_\"):\n      continue  # Skip over \"_key\" entries which are not ingredients\n    elif isinstance(ingredient_index, int):\n      actions.extend([0] * count)  # Assuming action 0 is for picking up the ingredient\n\n  if len(actions) > 2:\n    return [1,4] + ([2] * (len(recipe)-2))  # Move to each ingredient location and pick it up\n  else:\n    return [1,4] + actions  # If only one or no ingredients needed, just move to the crafting station and use", "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": 1.5}}
{"timestamp": "2025-05-10T13:30:09.993726", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes[item]\n  \n  # Initialize an empty list to store actions (indices)\n  actions = []\n\n  # Iterate over each ingredient in the recipe\n  for ingredient_index, count in recipe.items():\n    if isinstance(ingredient_index, str) and ingredient_index.startswith(\"_\"):\n      continue  # Skip over \"_key\" entries which are not ingredients\n    elif isinstance(ingredient_index, int):\n      actions.extend([0] * count)  # Assuming action 0 is for picking up the ingredient\n\n  return [1,4] + ([2] * len(recipe))[:len(actions)-2] + ([5]*max(len(recipe)-3,0)) + ([7]*min(len(recipe),3))  # Mix of move to and use actions", "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": -1}}
